title: "Rumen Methane Knowledge Graph: LLM-Assisted Evidence Synthesis of Seaweed-Derived Bioactives for Rumen Methane Mitigation (2015-2026)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-11
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/LammyG/seaweed-rumen-kg"
doi: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21763960"
abstract: "A 126-paper ontology-guided LLM knowledge graph covering seaweed-derived
  bioactive mechanisms for rumen methane mitigation. Contains 513 extracted edges,
  349 canonical nodes, and two-tier validation (pilot precision 96.4%; gold standard
  effect direction accuracy 1.000). Three bioactive classes covered: bromoform/
  halogenated (n=53), phlorotannin/polyphenol (n=59), and peptide/hydrolysate (n=2).
  Search period: January 2015 to July 2026."
keywords:
  - rumen methane
  - seaweed bioactives
  - knowledge graph
  - LLM extraction
  - systematic review
  - bromoform
  - phlorotannins
  - Asparagopsis taxiformis
  - methane mitigation
  - ruminant livestock
